{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "bf7f0df63c30775a4d9b42e47f1f19b71a7f735e3a0e7d6bcb674a90455815a3", "ja": "心をひとつに★レッツダンス！", "zh": "心连心★一起来跳舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bb357a00302e2e660a120b367a320cbcafbc3bea01bf040870d1cdd67b1f5d30", "ja": "アイドルたちの奔走もあり学生達はダンス\nへの思いを再確認する。かくして全員が\n同じ方向を向き、練習にも一層熱が入る。\nそしてダンスコラボの本番に向けて、\n止まらない情熱を解放していく。", "zh": "在偶像们的奔走下，学生们再次确认了自己对舞蹈的热爱。就这样，所有人目标一致，练习也更加投入。为了迎接舞蹈合作的正式演出，他们释放出永不止息的热情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1000_018ele", "source_sha256": "3761260c5099973646b4ad6de5fa8aa32bf225eea5816bb36ca23d52c17574e7", "ja": "というわけで、公演にダンス部のみんなを招待したノ！\nすっごく盛り上がってくれたんだヨ～♪", "zh": "所以呢，我们把舞蹈部的大家邀请来观看演出啦！\n他们可起劲了呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "500d5b26eafc34259dc8a55b84d2c23f2aa2b8351f1ebcec11e41f19e0fe9215", "ja": "みんなキラキラした目で、とっても楽しかったって\n言ってくれて。エヘヘ、喜んでくれてよかったナ♪", "zh": "大家眼睛都闪闪发亮的，还跟我说\n特别开心呢。嘿嘿，大家能喜欢真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a5a79a9e8eeaf18399e58d12894673b2e66838b2a218a74786c00bf61ea8aa9c", "ja": "練習の前に、みんなに話があるんだ。\nこの前、アタシ達のライブを見て、どうだった？", "zh": "在练习开始前，我有话要对大家说。\n前阵子看了我们的演出，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2f9959fb16cb142419e161a00dabd9236df849f78378f5e7c6a6d067dfa8d84a", "ja": "会場にいる人、全員の気持ちがひとつになったって。\nアタシはそう感じたんだ。", "zh": "我感受到，现场所有人的心情都融为了一体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "b994186ed66d6838e811884b721015fa6a35a40fe752acb54943e2f44ea6d960", "ja": "厳しいことを言うけど……今のまま練習を進めても、\n誰の気持ちも掴めないと思う。自分達も含めて。", "zh": "虽然说得有些严厉……但我觉得，就算继续照现在这样练习下去，也无法打动任何人的心。包括我们自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "2287472820eb4535e87a80527f9464aaa3e17eb1ac9d267513e7b35436a74784", "ja": "みんなはどうかな？　このまま、誰かが我慢して、\n誰かが満足して。それでいいと思う？", "zh": "大家觉得呢？就这样，让有人忍耐，有人满足。你们觉得这样就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "3d12c8b71935d9f185ba0876f01efd5e76b92d235b31a9dee57f8c8ba6b794cf", "ja": "きっとね。どんなダンスをするかってことより、どんな\n気持ちになるかってことの方が、大事なんだと思う。", "zh": "我觉得啊，比起跳什么样的舞，跳舞时怀着怎样的心情才更重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "adaea6325941fc70ba94251c8ce6617d1dc1803a55937cc2baca93487cba2bde", "ja": "みんな、ちょっと考えすぎじゃないかナ？\nテクニックも大事だけど、一番はパッション！", "zh": "大家是不是有点想太多了呢？\n技巧固然重要，但最重要的是热情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "29b3b01ada376fb7e5acdfa7e164bef9d8e7e8dbb1b766ccecb5eac674b25258", "ja": "リズムに任せて、体を動かして、表現して～。\n心も体も、繋がることを楽しむのがダンスだと思うヨ♪", "zh": "跟随节奏，动起身体，尽情表现吧～  \n我觉得，享受心与身体相互连接的过程，就是舞蹈的意义哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "6be3e91561c992d8235ee2be17f16770aa6a9b5621dc0fce32ae95b1e39bc801", "ja": "だから、今日はもう、コラボのことは置いといて。\nみんなで何も考えずに踊っちゃおう～！！", "zh": "所以，今天就先把合作的事放到一边吧。\n大家什么都别想，尽情跳起来吧～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1011_dannsubuinntati", "source_sha256": "d4556da9c72be55a6e628e68bc7e2390382ea34e263e43cd94d3594f6ec2ebcb", "ja": "……はいっ！", "zh": "……好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9a12d53c7fb199d7d65ff359cfc4dd1ca1ad532aeb58778ce0e9bf638e70d911", "ja": "戸惑ってた人も多かったけど、音楽が流れて、\nアタシ達が踊り始めると、我慢できなかったみたい。", "zh": "虽然有很多人一开始感到困惑，但音乐一响起来，我们开始跳舞，他们好像就忍不住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b3ec48daa4709c34c5e8baf44d55f9c8c2b677c08757196bf7d8f8227b69314e", "ja": "思い思いに踊り始めて、みんな楽しそうな顔になって\nいって。やっぱり、みんなダンスが好きなんだね♪", "zh": "大家都开始随心所欲地跳起舞来，脸上也渐渐露出了开心的表情。果然，大家都喜欢跳舞呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "64d6139f8c412511ca60e714886b266ffedccc8eae23300893c82a282a64c27a", "ja": "本番が近づいてくると、みんなのダンス熱も燃え上\nがって、また意見が違うことが出てきたけど……。", "zh": "随着正式演出临近，大家对舞蹈的热情也再次高涨起来，虽然又出现了意见分歧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "9e89c86f55e1dffe7d982b394c96845433e50d01d5e1219f3fe227687411becf", "ja": "でも、みんなが納得できるところを探そうって、\nそういう気持ちで話すようになりました☆", "zh": "不过，我们开始抱着寻找大家都能接受的方案的想法来交流了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1016_null", "source_sha256": "92578f4e149136cbae6cf1229c045877da95cfb2ba869f525fe96c05252e688b", "ja": "―最終リハーサル終了―", "zh": "——最终彩排结束——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "5261f4659afe39dc381e594f377794af241a9ed43a3dbc5dd0f2b0332c0c212e", "ja": "ふぅ……。なんとか、間に合ったかな？", "zh": "呼……总算是赶上了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8daf06fcb7a900dadef21e2e3f1449a05db3f46f2bf362b3a094f0be0f1ec0f1", "ja": "うん、もうバッチリ！　って、みんな頑張りすぎて、\nアタシ達もだいぶギリギリだけど！", "zh": "嗯，已经万无一失了！话是这么说，可大家也太拼了，\n连我们也几乎到了极限呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "52e70544630fa0cef32f7d70cec92b8f5a6009c2a8e6af659a0c75e1a9eb2598", "ja": "うう～……頭揺らしたら、振り付けこぼれそう……。", "zh": "呜呜～……感觉只要一晃脑袋，动作就会忘掉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "3e30ff1158c4f391b299cad4aebfe604347f7fe748ec716b304c0b9933675ed1", "ja": "ワーオ！　ノリコ、顔色が悪いヨ？\nスポドリとタオル、持ってくるネ～！", "zh": "哇哦！诺莉子，你脸色不太好耶？我去拿运动饮料和毛巾来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "8d49ea0b0dec6dd3c75617c759a7fc96a11c864d743bc9fb891e4344b6c6f139", "ja": "終盤の練習はすっごく厳しかったのに、\nダンス部のみんなはしっかりついて来てくれたんだ。", "zh": "虽然最后阶段的练习特别严格，但舞蹈部的大家都好好跟上来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "710ca996d1d15245bf60b29201945a45594c99dac00dc226174c0cf5694720cc", "ja": "緊張してる子や、鏡の前で練習してる子もいる……。\nけど、みんないい顔になったよね！", "zh": "有的孩子很紧张，也有的在镜子前练习……不过，大家的表情都变得很棒了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7ebb140ddf5a5b6717c56fa3deaf7ebc3f01a98ee7625ecb94f6773d7044d860", "ja": "みんな、集まってー！　……今から慌てても仕方ない。\n覚悟を決めて……本番、頑張ろう！", "zh": "大家集合啦——！……现在再慌也没用。\n下定决心……正式演出，加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "99f30f090d6e9847289ce130019412229b271e61ace59028d88a2ef9e984ecc3", "ja": "オーーーーー！", "zh": "噢————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "99f30f090d6e9847289ce130019412229b271e61ace59028d88a2ef9e984ecc3", "ja": "オーーーーー！", "zh": "噢————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "99f30f090d6e9847289ce130019412229b271e61ace59028d88a2ef9e984ecc3", "ja": "オーーーーー！", "zh": "噢————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "99f30f090d6e9847289ce130019412229b271e61ace59028d88a2ef9e984ecc3", "ja": "オーーーーー！", "zh": "噢————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1029_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "ce0c23779bef53fcaa51b4613094223916e12f9725030118711bd01d30124d15", "ja": "さて、VTRを見ていただきました。\nどうですか？　もうすぐステージのお披露目ですが。", "zh": "刚才请大家观看了录像。\n感觉怎么样？马上就要在舞台上正式亮相了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "6ddfcdbc1eee3026d88f7a8cac5a18808018f21d3fad54bea4f8c52dc6d6bf42", "ja": "えっと、すっごく緊張してるけど、\nたくさん練習してきたから大丈夫です！　……ね、歩！", "zh": "那个……虽然我现在特别紧张，\n但我们已经练习了很多，所以没问题！……对吧，步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7bc006137d86c4be4f9cac2c71b1419cc8cd9f509333c4e6d6e26571a3eefd47", "ja": "え！？　う、うん、やれることはやったからね！\nあとはもう、本番を見てもらうだけです！", "zh": "诶！？呃、嗯，该做的都做了嘛！\n接下来只要让大家看看正式演出就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "a972d8b3f6836927d95602c01f59b494d5be31d2c667f22aae4c9e8cf4cf73fd", "ja": "アタシ達はワンチーム！　みんなの思いをダンスに\n乗せて、全力で表現するよ！", "zh": "我们是一个团队！把大家的心意融入舞蹈，全力展现出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "c0c298b7ae3d6ecd39941cbdaf1ec23e2e7885db66b214a7e8e79c3d12d60be4", "ja": "ウン！　ワタシ達と美楽留高校ダンス部、みーんなで\n繋がったステージ、一緒に楽しんでネ♪", "zh": "嗯！我们和美乐留高校舞蹈部，大家一起连接起来的舞台，要一起享受哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_04_1034_018ele", "source_sha256": "9b15eee938f9aef7f78f69e947636da9c57db2b399241ab5ee8d87dd8044fac4", "ja": "曲はもちろん、ワタシ達\n『miraclesonic★expassion』の～。", "zh": "曲子当然是我们\n『miraclesonic★expassion』的——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
